---
<section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 text-teal-800 text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-8">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500"></span>
      Skill para Claude Code · v11.0.0
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight tracking-tight mb-6">
      Diseña guías universitarias<br />
      <span class="text-teal-700">verificables con evidencia</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
      Jíntia convierte sílabos y fuentes del curso en guías didácticas semanales, actividades,
      rúbricas y evaluaciones alineadas con UDL 3.0, Backward Design y Quality Matters —
      respaldadas por NotebookLM.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="#instalar"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-teal-700 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-teal-800 transition-colors"
      >
        Instalar Jíntia
      </a>
      <a
        href="#como-funciona"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-700 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors border border-slate-200"
      >
        Ver cómo funciona
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pb-20">
  <div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 border-b border-slate-700">
      <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
      <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500"></span>
      <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span>
      <span class="ml-2 text-slate-400 text-xs font-mono">terminal</span>
    </div>
    <div class="p-6 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-slate-400">$ <span class="text-green-400">npx @charlie.act7/jintia install</span></p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 mt-2">✔ Jíntia instalada en ~/.claude/skills/jintia-skill</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500">✔ NotebookLM MCP configurado</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500">✔ Temas HTML listos: jintia-clasico · jintia-tecnico · jintia-cuaderno</p>
      <p class="text-teal-400 mt-3">→ Abre Claude Code y escribe: <span class="text-white">/jintia guía semana 3</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
